/Title (The agent economy is a $10.91B market in 2026 sprinting to $52.62B by 2030, and it is built on quicksand. Gartner says 40% of agentic AI projects will be canceled by 2027, 88% never reach production, and only 5% of Copilot pilots ever scale. The math is brutal, frontier agents complete real CRM workflows below 55%. Every framework like LangGraph, CrewAI, AutoGen treats agents as stateless workers.)
